    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>23级 精英 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 428；''重伤'' 214</span><span>''先攻'' +19</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 37，''强韧'' 35，''反射'' 35，''意志'' 36</span><span>''侦查'' +11</span></div>\n<div><span>''豁免'' +2；''行动点'' 1</span><span></span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">绝对疯狂</div>\n<div class=description>人类疯狂贵族不会引发借机攻击。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}节杖（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+28 vs. AC<br>命中：3d8+6 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}疯狂飓风✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>该人类疯狂贵族快步 6 格并对它在移动中邻接的每一个敌人进行一次节杖攻击。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}恶毒狂怒（武器）</div>\n<div class=description>触发：当首次重伤时。<br>攻击：近程爆发 1，以敌人为目标，+26 vs. AC<br>命中：3d8+6 伤害，且目标倒地。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（人类疯狂贵族）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 坚韧+23</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 16（+14）</span><span>''敏捷'' 22（+17）</span><span>''感知'' 11（+11）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 22（+17）</span><span>''智力'' 15（+13）</span><span>''魅力'' 24（+18）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 混乱邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 节杖（硬头锤）</span></div></div>\n</div>",
